ISO-10303-21;
/* Gp080: PLANE Z=0; defect edge: 3D curve degree-2 B-spline C-1 break at t=0.5 (CP[2]=(1.5,0,0) vs CP[3]=(3.0,0,0), 1.5-unit gap); PCurve is OFFSET_CURVE_2D(basis=LINE from (0,0.5) dir=(1,0), offset=0.3); EDGE_CURVE same_sense=.F. → FixReversed2d reverses basis dir to (-1,0) but leaves offset=+0.3 (should flip to -0.3), inverting pcurve from (u,0.8) to (u,0.2); C-1 break drives shape_null */
